    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people want to help but it feels like they're just saying that to be nice. it wouldn't actually fix anything. the interest alone is more than i make in a month. it's just an endless loop of misery. sometimes i think about how things would just... go quiet. no more calls, no more stress, no more feeling like a failure. it's almost like a logical solution when everything else is just broken, isn't it?\n Balance the idea somehow just ending the struggle. wrong?",
